{"4170170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Almost certain death.", "steam_appid": 4170170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1> Plot</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lin Wei ventures alone into northern Myanmar to rescue her closest friend, but despite her meticulous planning, she still falls into the clutches of Mr. Chen. In the end, they are forced to take desperate risks in their fight for freedom. Whether they can escape this living nightmare depends on the choices you make for them! With nearly 100 different options, each leads to a distinct ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170170/extras/3eae641eb59a981cb288353796166691.poster.avif?t=1770166402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170170/extras/3eae641eb59a981cb288353796166691.webm?t=1770166402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170170/extras/3eae641eb59a981cb288353796166691.mp4?t=1770166402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>Lin wei</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just relax and enjoy the game. Every choice you make matters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170170/extras/ff21398d32995569fae1d3c619014f0a.poster.avif?t=1770166402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170170/extras/ff21398d32995569fae1d3c619014f0a.webm?t=1770166402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>LI na</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every decision, you redefine their destiny<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170170/extras/849df7d0f9c744f2c5c1263dee452d14.poster.avif?t=1770166402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170170/extras/849df7d0f9c744f2c5c1263dee452d14.webm?t=1770166402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life is filled with endless choices—some right, some wrong, some made under pressure, some reckless, and some deliberate. So, what will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Almost Certain Death&quot; is a branching narrative game where every action you take may set off unforeseen consequences later in the story. Players will face survival and moral dilemmas, forced to make difficult decisions that shape their fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170170/extras/84dabe0ec0d04e6af89fb58ba6ad8a6e.poster.avif?t=1770166402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170170/extras/84dabe0ec0d04e6af89fb58ba6ad8a6e.webm?t=1770166402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170170/extras/84dabe0ec0d04e6af89fb58ba6ad8a6e.mp4?t=1770166402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life is filled with endless choices—some right, some wrong, some made under pressure, some reckless, and some deliberate. So, what will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Almost Certain Death&quot; is a branching narrative game where every action you take may set off unforeseen consequences later in